Subject: Preserve independent legacy APT lock imports

Legacy import_lock callers may select separate payload locks alongside apt.install.
Keep their existing per-lock repositories while retaining strict root-authoritative
production-lock validation for explicit unified inputs and canonical _inputs locks.
This fixes the Framework/Common graph without changing published .17 or its inputs.

